 * 1. Finds PR associated with the ticket
 * 2. Checks out the PR branch
 * 3. Writes input folder: pr_info.md, pr_diff.txt, pr_discussions.md, pr_discussions_raw.json
 * 4. Posts "Review Started" comment to Jira
