Wait — that can't be... unless the console output truncated? Let me look at more output. RESULT line got cut. The push happens BEFORE throw, so checkoutPRBranch should be entry[0]. Unless the current code does NOT call gitOps.checkoutPRBranch! Let me re-look at the current checkout code... 

